<title>INDIA: India HLL 1996 productwise sales data.</title>
<headline>India HLL 1996 productwise sales data.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unilever Plc India subsidiary Hindustan Lever Ltd on Friday gave the following sales figures for its various product groups for calendar 1996.</p>
<p>The figures for 1995 are not comparable because of the amalgamation of the business with another Unilever subsidiary Brooke Bond Lipton India Ltd in 1996 and transfer of HLL's chemicals and fertilisers business to another group firm. -------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>						 (Rs. Million)</p>
<p>					  1996	    1995</p>
<p>Soaps &amp; Detergents		 29,220	  19,840</p>
<p>Personal Products		   6,360	   3,910</p>
<p>Beverages			    13,130		--</p>
<p>Processed triglycerides,</p>
<p>  Oils &amp; Vanaspati		  4,790	   1,480</p>
<p>Daily Products			  830		--</p>
<p>Ice Creams &amp; Frozen Desserts    1,350		--</p>
<p>Canned &amp; Processed Fruits and</p>
<p>  Vegetables			  1,040		--</p>
<p>Speciality Chemicals		1,250	     940</p>
<p>Sodium Tripolyphosphate		--	     320</p>
<p>DiAmmonium Phosphate		   --	   2,500</p>
<p>Animal Feeding Stuffs	     2,370		--</p>
<p>Others				  5,660	   4,680</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Total				  66,000	  33,670</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>Profits:</p>
<p>-------</p>
<p>Profit Before Tax		   6,052.50	3,722.20</p>
<p>Tax on Profit			(1,925.50)    (1,330.00)</p>
<p>Profit After Tax		    4,127.00	2,392.20</p>
<p>Extraordinary items		    15.60		--</p>
<p>Net Profit			    4,142.60	2,392.20</p>
<p>Tax Adjustments for</p>
<p>  previous years			(27.50)	 (76.20)</p>
<p>Leave salary provision for</p>
<p>  earlier years			 (90.10)	     --</p>
<p>Depreciation			   5,52.60		--</p>
